      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WEST ON MENACE (2) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into second last time out (42.47) over 715m at this track. Can make amends this time. WEST ON SIDNEY (7) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 4.5 lengths at this track in a handy 34.61 beating TAKE MY ADVICE. Yet to miss the placings in four runs from this box, including two wins. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. ALL ABOUT COAL (1) showed good early speed and led throughout to score by a space when a 7 length winner at Mandurah over 652m (37.76). Solid record here winning seven races. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Deserves serious consideration again. TAKE MY ADVICE (5) placed last start and is in the mix again.",
